### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Run `npm run seed` first.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Carla Lim", "email": "carla@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

### Login (copy the accessToken into @token below)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List my accounts
GET {{base}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Open a savings account
POST {{base}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "savings" }

### Deposit
POST {{base}}/api/accounts/1/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 250.75, "description": "Salary" }

### Withdraw
POST {{base}}/api/accounts/1/withdrawals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 40, "description": "ATM" }

### Transfer (replace toAccountNumber with Bob's number printed by the seed script)
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": 1, "toAccountNumber": "0000000000", "amount": 100, "description": "Rent share" }

### Transaction history
GET {{base}}/api/accounts/1/transactions?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
